abstract: >-
  Code and lightweight result summaries for an audit of reliability diagnostics for neural
  groundwater contaminant-transport surrogates under an input-visible conductivity-variance
  shift and an omitted-control transport stress test. Unpaired transport pools have distinguishable conductivity fields.
